  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "三月二十日，立委王崑崙氏，在重慶宴蘇聯作家及中國作家的席上，有人提議，聯合起來，寫一封信來給我的消息，早在香港報上見過。",
      "output_sha256": "5110d1ad46b0d47ede371184ac6d0f9828fd1b9bc6a8899ff9bd493698b0b1d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "5110d1ad46b0d47ede371184ac6d0f9828fd1b9bc6a8899ff9bd493698b0b1d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "本坡的《星中報》也轉載了這則消息。",
      "output_sha256": "bf63e1b7f986aca9fe1c9f14a01ca76df8a2180536fd6f3f97723f393e3eeff5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.594048,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c9975c02558d2922ce1b08c67e2f7a14f2a6b17bb696c82f5dfa0ddeeec02a45"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bf63e1b7f986aca9fe1c9f14a01ca76df8a2180536fd6f3f97723f393e3eeff5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "詩是四句：莫道流離苦（老舍），天涯一客孤（沫若），舉杯祝遠道（崑崙），萬里四行書（施誼）。",
      "output_sha256": "c875e62f743aa328a6a4dec729fb423d3d2ef9a32a2be80c8a49870873e4220b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "c875e62f743aa328a6a4dec729fb423d3d2ef9a32a2be80c8a49870873e4220b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "施誼當然是孫師毅的另一寫法。",
      "output_sha256": "46bc19c4ed691c580c7a0566e02d4a113398dab3f7d7433099423eaa9a244dcf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "46bc19c4ed691c580c7a0566e02d4a113398dab3f7d7433099423eaa9a244dcf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此外到席者，是蘇聯的作家費德連克（他也用了中國筆，寫了“都問你好”的四字），及米克拉舍夫斯基（他寫的是“知己知彼，百戰百勝”的兩句孫子兵法）。",
      "output_sha256": "435f8004149e42ce6fb66d8b2aef876763bfffffd0adc99a3c5d75cc4d9de45c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "435f8004149e42ce6fb66d8b2aef876763bfffffd0adc99a3c5d75cc4d9de45c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這兩位蘇聯作家竟能用中國的毛筆寫出如此字跡（雖然看起來像初學者的筆法），實在難得。",
      "output_sha256": "580108ac352ab966be4d5e4f4e65e7eeffe48d03bc9d9a1bc87fda4778ed50a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.620082,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "171a5cc9761eb5cfa98db665bb8972b0721719260cc244f04d40a89f991bbc2d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "580108ac352ab966be4d5e4f4e65e7eeffe48d03bc9d9a1bc87fda4778ed50a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "當日出席的還有曾經傳聞遭敵人謀害的陳波兒、方殷、戈寶權、葛一虹、陽翰笙等人。",
      "output_sha256": "fa072c6da21f657af70cb85c456f4bb1dae1ba4b9e44c568ba5fcc9c82cc43b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.674889,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b325c4e706b3b39b0284ca68a6fe4137984d67c260574ced92627fff7ebfef77"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fa072c6da21f657af70cb85c456f4bb1dae1ba4b9e44c568ba5fcc9c82cc43b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "沫若在詩下，還寫有幾行短信：",
      "output_sha256": "bbc5728b5641df1ba00f2b0360d9f84f134ecddb54a6a80369632341dd4a1824",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbc5728b5641df1ba00f2b0360d9f84f134ecddb54a6a80369632341dd4a1824",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "達夫：詩上雖說你孤，其實你並不孤。",
      "output_sha256": "e686ebdc317f90688adee01f13308f34bf6df30d59fecae86bde1372e4aa325a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "e686ebdc317f90688adee01f13308f34bf6df30d59fecae86bde1372e4aa325a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "今天在座的，都在思念你，全中國的青年朋友，都在思念你。",
      "output_sha256": "d6abf029b165594dac9cf6513335daca7ba7d88239bcba53cbeb276947ac4293",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6abf029b165594dac9cf6513335daca7ba7d88239bcba53cbeb276947ac4293",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你知道張資平的消息麼？",
      "output_sha256": "056994008210a48cfd4c9da33118c5f87d29cd44832c6cc5ba3414cd9f57fad7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "056994008210a48cfd4c9da33118c5f87d29cd44832c6cc5ba3414cd9f57fad7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他竟然迷失了方向，真是可嘆！",
      "output_sha256": "edd9edb568ee878710a3066611e27b7d0f0d5d4e59763038d9c680621d49317a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.42458,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4d16f5e20e98aec710d99bea612cfdd677f380c994c43f3acb12c25a4e3d2ba0",
        "f88c1b7702d3affe04d46bc2e4f564a53906093e8636090e19848564f1b83aea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "edd9edb568ee878710a3066611e27b7d0f0d5d4e59763038d9c680621d49317a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "◇",
      "output_sha256": "f88c1b7702d3affe04d46bc2e4f564a53906093e8636090e19848564f1b83aea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.42458,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4d16f5e20e98aec710d99bea612cfdd677f380c994c43f3acb12c25a4e3d2ba0",
        "f88c1b7702d3affe04d46bc2e4f564a53906093e8636090e19848564f1b83aea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f88c1b7702d3affe04d46bc2e4f564a53906093e8636090e19848564f1b83aea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "從這封同人合寫的信中，我們可以得知，張資平在上海被敵人收買的事情確實屬實。",
      "output_sha256": "451411f32b345ba972494cef1bded9580f4b6e7542822f011f3e4cd9946ce025",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.712972,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b1f6b524595363b8ec6cfb3d67452efe3440645b2ced5da4c626274165b490e1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "451411f32b345ba972494cef1bded9580f4b6e7542822f011f3e4cd9946ce025",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "本來，我們是最不願意聽到認識的舊日友人，有這一種喪盡天良的行爲的；譬如周作人的附逆，我們在初期，也每以爲是不確，是敵人故意放造的謠言；但日久見人心，終於到了現在，也被證實是事實了。",
      "output_sha256": "94753789563357815aac417daa68f40f4065f1b5d03050fa8595507e8131fec0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "94753789563357815aac417daa68f40f4065f1b5d03050fa8595507e8131fec0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "文化界而出這一種人，實在是中國人千古洗不掉的羞恥事，以春秋的筆法來下評語，他們該比被收買的土匪和政客，都應罪加一等。",
      "output_sha256": "e370440bb4a164cede1d910a6689b949d754ff5cd331237e24c60e8d5e970b82",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "e370440bb4a164cede1d910a6689b949d754ff5cd331237e24c60e8d5e970b82",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "時窮節乃見，古人所說的非至歲寒，不能見松柏之堅貞，自是確語。",
      "output_sha256": "d92d5d79ba4d81b93c66299b4f679cae65b402b0a6dc0dd2bf4d439a9254a21f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "d92d5d79ba4d81b93c66299b4f679cae65b402b0a6dc0dd2bf4d439a9254a21f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以，耳未聽見過炮聲，足未踏入過戰地的許多文化人，只站在後方的後方，高喊着前進，或用盡心機，想打倒幾個在同一區域中作同事的同人來獻身手的，亦當以這些先例爲前車之戒。",
      "output_sha256": "fc6b072351b838deb9e4c6ab52cee40d34742aa3420a12b3ea1595c1c96963ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc6b072351b838deb9e4c6ab52cee40d34742aa3420a12b3ea1595c1c96963ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "能做一點實際工作，當遠勝於專向同事作人身攻擊等事，爲益多多。",
      "output_sha256": "667d9f177560f05a0b875e8547adf914533297154ac5abb2f506d9bb2c76baa9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "667d9f177560f05a0b875e8547adf914533297154ac5abb2f506d9bb2c76baa9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅也曾說過，既然是人，自然也要性交，若只拿住性交的一點，來攻擊個人，則孔夫子有伯魚。",
      "output_sha256": "f71cbb91f96ce3ff0002156518fd36bcbcad40d319287fcb8b8ee61bc9f26693",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "f71cbb91f96ce3ff0002156518fd36bcbcad40d319287fcb8b8ee61bc9f26693",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "即使是聖到無以復加的聖人，恐怕日常生活，也是和我們這些庸人，相差無幾的。",
      "output_sha256": "e0f2e13a9c6f92a0653742b4b7d3927031a01d7d6b45d278c69d2395b46f37d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "e0f2e13a9c6f92a0653742b4b7d3927031a01d7d6b45d278c69d2395b46f37d7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“文人無行”，是中國慣說的一句口頭語；但我們應當曉得，無行的就不是文人，能說“失節事大，餓死事小”這話而實際做到的人，纔是真正的文人。",
      "output_sha256": "066083e32431e2841052c1710ae930f5a22cdbb2d36d911195b93c5e188a5e9f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "066083e32431e2841052c1710ae930f5a22cdbb2d36d911195b93c5e188a5e9f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "近如洪承疇，遠如長樂老，他們何嘗是文人，他們不過是學過寫字、讀過書的政客罷了。",
      "output_sha256": "25225de2d82634bedcea337e37bcaf1b5eccaf10254aef5ef7454d1cc582d03e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.874905,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3bcffefc662e875e06a95dcbb50154d7c91c3d270d503beedc58068def05ed99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "25225de2d82634bedcea337e37bcaf1b5eccaf10254aef5ef7454d1cc582d03e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至如遠處在離敵人數千裏外的異域，只以爲月薪比自己多一點，生活比自己寬裕一點的同事，就是阻遏自己加薪前進的障礙，是敵寇，是漢奸，是一手壓住世界命的魔鬼；像這樣的文人，當然更不是文人了；因爲這些人們，敵寇不來則已，敵寇若一到門，則首先去跪接稱臣，高呼萬歲的，也就是他們了；對這些而也稱作文人，豈不是辱沒了文人的正氣，辱沒了謝皋羽的西臺。",
      "output_sha256": "f645b85b6e615fe9d9b9225efebe63be62753a587b399fad33a01fca3539a10a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "f645b85b6e615fe9d9b9225efebe63be62753a587b399fad33a01fca3539a10a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因為聽聞故人竟做出叛逆之事，心中充滿牢騷無法發泄，依我個人境遇而言，老母在故鄉殉國，胞兄在孤島殉職，他們雖不是文人，從未在副刊上發表過激昂的文章，或隨意攻擊過誰，但我卻希望以真正的文人來看待他們，尊稱他們為我的榜樣，是我精神上的指導者。",
      "output_sha256": "2f5b47b836d20b6246677ed2960d4b73c3de7d179297e4014e858fe3f3c77ccc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.625303,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "df0028240f832818953c062c7b994908ca91bc72d3af4ca400e10c03725976f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2f5b47b836d20b6246677ed2960d4b73c3de7d179297e4014e858fe3f3c77ccc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們的抗戰仍需繼續。",
      "output_sha256": "b7ba901527e122437f3580286a78a865930243cc4fa509b198ce88ffe7b89c9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.549825,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5b5b85422c26a2d173c3914a7d91213222f0422351c55daaaeae8651fe501e60"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b7ba901527e122437f3580286a78a865930243cc4fa509b198ce88ffe7b89c9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這中間，自然更有許多花樣出來，可以給我們歎賞，或給我們唾罵。",
